## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a real-time data pipeline with end-to-end correctness, cross-project IAM, and robust operability under outages.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub ingestion and dead-letter handling
- Dataflow (Apache Beam) streaming with exactly-once semantics
- BigQuery streaming inserts with insertId for idempotency
- Cross-project IAM and least privilege
- Canary rollout and observability (dashboards, lag alerts)

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: generate insertId function for BigQuery streaming inserts
function buildRecord(event) {
  return {
    insertId: `${event.deviceId}|${event.messageId}|${event.timestamp}`,
    json: {
      deviceId: event.deviceId,
      region: event.region,
      timestamp: event.timestamp,
      metrics: event.metrics
    }
  };
}
```

